voidrice:
.Lk https://github.com/LukeSmithxyz/voidrice
.Sh HISTORY
.Nm
was ported from Luke Smith's voidrice in 2026.
.Sh CAVEATS
.Nm
has been tested off the machine, against mocked
.Ox
commands, and not yet on an X220.
Not yet run there: the installer, the suspend lock on a lid close,
.Xr dump 8
and
.Xr restore 8
on the backup disk, the update count's reading of
.Ic pkg_add -u -n -v ,
the dictionary build, the Codex box's walls and the TrackPoint scroll.
.Pp
After the first boot, run
.Pa ~/.local/share/vertrice/tests/check ,
once, as the user, inside X.
It changes nothing and prints PASS or FAIL for each item.
